WEBVTT

00:00.830 --> 00:04.370
Give light to the stars, bless the earth,

00:04.370 --> 00:07.500
and give thanks to the Witch of Dawn, Flora.

00:09.370 --> 00:10.830
It's almost time.

00:10.830 --> 00:13.330
I'm so excited!

00:13.330 --> 00:16.870
We're all set! Let's get ready to rock!

00:16.870 --> 00:19.080
I can't believe we're going
to sing at the Cester Festival!

00:19.080 --> 00:21.200
It's like a dream come true!

00:21.200 --> 00:22.830
We'll have to hype up the crowd.

00:22.830 --> 00:24.910
Well, look at you, all motivated.

00:24.910 --> 00:28.160
I'm not the old Mary anymore...

00:28.160 --> 00:29.410
Maybe.

00:29.410 --> 00:32.870
At this rate, we're gonna be a huge hit!

00:34.410 --> 00:36.540
Champe?

00:36.540 --> 00:38.700
Yeah, of course.

00:38.700 --> 00:39.950
What's wrong?

00:39.950 --> 00:42.700
Are you... nervous?

00:44.620 --> 00:49.830
Not exactly. It's just been
really lonely lately.

00:52.330 --> 00:54.120
Don't worry.

00:54.120 --> 00:58.620
I'm sure they've met up with Tiara by now
and they're figuring stuff out.

00:58.620 --> 01:00.750
Yeah, I'm sure you're right.

01:04.620 --> 01:05.950
What's wrong?

01:05.950 --> 01:07.620
If you're not going to eat,
I'll just help myself.

01:09.790 --> 01:12.790
We need to practice tons to get ready
for the Cester Festival!

01:12.790 --> 01:15.080
We can't go over the top too much!

01:15.080 --> 01:18.330
Well, the beat's just not gonna stop!

01:19.660 --> 01:20.870
Luci.

01:20.870 --> 01:21.950
What?

01:23.450 --> 01:25.160
Angelica?

01:25.160 --> 01:27.370
I need to tell you something later.

01:28.280 --> 01:33.610
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

01:28.280 --> 01:33.610
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

01:33.610 --> 01:38.110
Seven colours are not enough

01:33.610 --> 01:38.110
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

01:38.110 --> 01:43.780
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

01:38.110 --> 01:41.110
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

01:41.110 --> 01:43.780
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

01:43.780 --> 01:49.780
The story is going beyond

01:43.780 --> 01:49.780
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

01:53.950 --> 01:59.280
The bell toll in my heart

01:53.950 --> 01:59.280
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

01:59.280 --> 02:03.610
is getting louder bit by bit

01:59.280 --> 02:03.610
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

02:03.610 --> 02:07.110
Believe in the excitement

02:03.610 --> 02:07.110
sono takanari wo shinjite

02:07.110 --> 02:09.610
And take one step forward

02:07.110 --> 02:09.610
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

02:09.610 --> 02:16.940
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

02:09.610 --> 02:16.940
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

02:15.280 --> 02:17.940
Can't be for sure

02:15.280 --> 02:17.940
zettai nante nai

02:16.940 --> 02:19.610
Nothing

02:16.940 --> 02:19.610
nanimo

02:17.940 --> 02:20.610
There's no guarantee

02:17.940 --> 02:20.610
kakushin wa dekinai

02:19.610 --> 02:22.280
No one

02:19.610 --> 02:22.280
daremo

02:20.610 --> 02:23.280
But I won't give up

02:20.610 --> 02:23.280
demo akiramenai

02:22.280 --> 02:24.940
That's why

02:22.280 --> 02:24.940
dakara

02:23.280 --> 02:25.440
I can still move forward

02:23.280 --> 02:25.440
susundeku koto ga

02:25.270 --> 02:26.780
I can still move forward

02:25.270 --> 02:26.780
dekiru yo

02:26.780 --> 02:32.610
Because there's magic right in here

02:26.780 --> 02:32.610
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

02:32.610 --> 02:38.940
It started to be brighter than the stars

02:32.610 --> 02:38.940
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

02:38.940 --> 02:43.610
I can't stop now

02:38.940 --> 02:43.610
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

02:43.610 --> 02:49.280
It entered into a new era

02:43.610 --> 02:49.280
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

02:49.280 --> 02:53.610
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

02:49.280 --> 02:53.610
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

02:53.610 --> 02:57.280
And go beyond the future

02:53.610 --> 02:57.280
saki no hou e

02:59.700 --> 03:02.290
Man, I'm stuffed!

03:02.290 --> 03:04.540
Every day is a feast.

03:04.540 --> 03:07.160
This place is on another level.

03:07.160 --> 03:11.410
We eat, play, and sleep. Is this Heaven?

03:19.620 --> 03:20.870
Um...

03:20.870 --> 03:24.370
What were we supposed to be doing again?

03:24.370 --> 03:26.580
What are you talking about, Lynette?

03:26.580 --> 03:28.910
Yeah. We're...

03:28.910 --> 03:30.700
...supposed to meet up with Tia-chan and...

03:34.000 --> 03:35.830
What the heck are we doing?!

03:55.790 --> 03:59.500
We've been told to make sure
you do not leave the palace.

04:15.580 --> 04:16.790
Thank you.

04:16.790 --> 04:19.790
It's nothing, really.

04:19.790 --> 04:22.910
It's so much easier now that
you don't wet your bed anymore.

04:22.910 --> 04:25.000
Oh, Anna...

04:27.450 --> 04:31.250
Hey, aren't there fewer guards than usual?

04:31.250 --> 04:34.580
They've been sent out to help
exterminate the Magical Monsters.

04:34.580 --> 04:35.830
The Magical Monsters?

04:35.830 --> 04:39.160
Yes. It seems to be quite the ordeal.

04:39.160 --> 04:43.330
I heard that Leskarka was attacked
by a horde of Magical Monsters...

04:43.330 --> 04:45.410
It's absolutely awful, isn't it?

04:45.410 --> 04:49.790
I heard those Magical Monsters
were heading toward Malmcester.

04:49.790 --> 04:51.160
Malmcester?!

04:51.160 --> 04:54.200
Wait, Anna! What's going on?

04:54.200 --> 04:56.290
Oh, it's nothing...

04:56.290 --> 05:00.500
Something is going on!
Why won't you tell me any more?!

05:00.500 --> 05:03.290
I really can't say any more...

05:05.040 --> 05:07.790
So my sister must've asked you to keep quiet.

05:09.330 --> 05:11.160
Anna, please...

05:11.160 --> 05:12.410
But...

05:14.370 --> 05:15.950
We're sorry, Tia-chan!

05:15.950 --> 05:17.540
Something came over us!

05:17.540 --> 05:20.330
Before we knew it,
we let this lavish lifestyle take over!

05:22.080 --> 05:24.250
Tiara-san?

05:24.250 --> 05:27.540
Everyone... Malmcester is...

05:28.870 --> 05:30.200
Is something wrong?

05:32.830 --> 05:34.750
Are you all ready?

05:34.750 --> 05:36.580
We're on the ball!

05:36.580 --> 05:39.790
We're going to have the most
rockin' Orchestra ever!

05:39.790 --> 05:43.160
Well, as long as you don't hold us back.

05:43.160 --> 05:45.450
We'll do our best to pay you back.

05:45.450 --> 05:46.660
Pay us back?

05:46.660 --> 05:49.620
You know... You helped Mary out
back in those mountains.

05:49.620 --> 05:51.450
That was just...

05:51.450 --> 05:54.700
It's not like I contributed much.

05:54.700 --> 05:57.950
Actually, we're grateful we got to meet Garnet.

05:57.950 --> 06:02.160
We're going to do our best
and become Noir rank someday!

06:03.700 --> 06:08.700
I look forward to that. Hopefully by then,
we'll be able to surpass supernova...

06:12.500 --> 06:16.040
It looks like you're all here. I apologize
for summoning you so suddenly.

06:20.790 --> 06:26.330
I ask that you do not speak of what
I'm about to say to those not involved.

06:26.330 --> 06:30.830
You are all going to perform Orchestras
at Cester Festival... Correct?

06:30.830 --> 06:33.200
We are, yes...

06:33.200 --> 06:35.080
Though we seem to have an outsider.

06:36.870 --> 06:40.410
Shut up. I'm only helping out because I have to.

06:40.410 --> 06:42.450
But all you ever do is play hooky.

06:42.450 --> 06:45.910
Haven't you ever heard "A wisewoman
doesn't show off all her talents"?

06:45.910 --> 06:48.160
You're totally bluffing.

06:48.160 --> 06:52.660
She is rather skilled, despite her slacking...

06:52.660 --> 06:54.540
Wouldn't you say so, Angers?

06:56.250 --> 06:58.660
You idiot!

06:58.660 --> 07:02.200
Director, what did you just...

07:02.200 --> 07:06.040
Her name is Angers. She's Angers from Ray.

07:07.200 --> 07:09.580
Ehh?!

07:09.580 --> 07:11.540
Why did have to tell even more people for?!

07:11.540 --> 07:14.540
I thought this would move
the conversation along faster.

07:14.540 --> 07:17.290
Damn it... You'll pay for this.

07:17.290 --> 07:21.540
Angers-chan? Are you really Angers-chan?

07:21.540 --> 07:23.040
Yeah, I am.

07:23.040 --> 07:24.370
No way!

07:24.370 --> 07:29.250
I mean, Angers-chan is... such a cute little angel!

07:29.250 --> 07:32.660
How did you end up looking like that?
Is it a new kind of curse?

07:32.660 --> 07:35.660
Hey! That's going way too far!

07:35.660 --> 07:38.000
You're really, truly, Angers-chan?

07:38.000 --> 07:39.830
For the last time, yes!

07:41.790 --> 07:45.750
For real?! Angers-chyan, shake my hand!

07:45.750 --> 07:49.750
I'm such a huge fan of Ray!
This is like a dream!

07:49.750 --> 07:53.540
Hey, could I get an autograph? Oh, and one
for Mary... And Champe! And, and...

07:53.540 --> 07:56.540
May I proceed?

07:56.540 --> 08:01.870
Your Orchestras will be held
in specific districts as usual,

08:01.870 --> 08:04.200
but I'd like you all to start at the same time.

08:06.700 --> 08:10.500
A horde of Magical Monsters
is heading to Malmcester.

08:13.660 --> 08:17.160
The attack on Leskarka
just happened the other day,

08:17.160 --> 08:20.450
but what happened in Alnwick
is still fresh in our memories, as well.

08:21.620 --> 08:23.870
But Alnwick is...

08:25.870 --> 08:30.330
It hasn't really been made public,
but they were attacked.

08:30.330 --> 08:33.950
Is that why you said your home was in trouble?

08:33.950 --> 08:37.160
Of course, the kingdom is helping us out,

08:37.160 --> 08:39.750
but my father wanted to help restore
the place as soon as possible

08:39.750 --> 08:42.330
and dipped into his own funds...

08:42.330 --> 08:47.580
Tiara-sama, do you know how
Flora Girls Academy was established?

08:47.580 --> 08:48.830
Yes.

08:48.830 --> 08:51.250
Flora-sama sealed away a Magical Monster

08:51.250 --> 08:54.830
and created the academy where that happened.

08:54.830 --> 08:59.580
That and the fact that Orchestras
progressed so much in Malmcester

08:59.580 --> 09:01.950
are deeply connected.

09:01.950 --> 09:04.200
The mana collected from the Orchestras

09:04.200 --> 09:08.330
reinforces the seal upon the Magical Monster.

09:08.330 --> 09:12.160
The witch Flora foresaw that there would
be an attack to break that seal,

09:12.160 --> 09:16.200
so she created the Prism Wall
to surround the city.

09:16.200 --> 09:19.660
If we use that,
the Magical Monsters will be purged.

09:19.660 --> 09:21.290
Something like that exists?

09:21.290 --> 09:23.660
Then we're safe.

09:23.660 --> 09:26.830
But to activate the Prism Wall,

09:26.830 --> 09:30.200
we need an immense amount
of mana instantaneously.

09:30.200 --> 09:32.250
That's why I'd like you to perform

09:32.250 --> 09:34.620
Orchestras to gather
all that mana from the city.

09:35.790 --> 09:38.000
So this will all depend on us?

09:40.540 --> 09:42.950
Precisely.

09:42.950 --> 09:44.830
What if it's not enough?

09:45.950 --> 09:47.870
We may perish.

09:49.330 --> 09:52.200
All right. Leave it to us.

09:52.200 --> 09:56.040
Yes. I'm sure IV KLORE
will be more than enough.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.250
Yeah, right.

09:57.250 --> 09:58.790
What did you say?!

10:01.910 --> 10:06.750
Supernova, IV KLORE, Konohana wa Otome,

10:06.750 --> 10:11.040
Sugar Pockets, and Sadistic Candy.

10:11.040 --> 10:14.330
I'm placing the fate
of this city in your hands.

10:16.000 --> 10:21.080
So the reason my sister was
against me going to the academy...

10:21.080 --> 10:22.410
Probably, yes...

10:24.120 --> 10:25.580
Tia...

10:25.580 --> 10:28.000
Will everyone be okay?

10:28.000 --> 10:29.580
We'll just have to pray they are.

10:31.160 --> 10:33.500
I have to go.

10:33.500 --> 10:35.830
I can't just sit here!

10:35.830 --> 10:37.750
You mustn't, Tiara-sama!

10:37.750 --> 10:41.250
Not to mention,
Eliza-sama has forbidden you to leave...

10:41.250 --> 10:43.330
Then I'll just...

10:43.330 --> 10:44.950
...have her take that back!

10:47.080 --> 10:50.410
Tiara-sama, please calm down.

10:50.410 --> 10:53.370
I'm sure Eliza-sama has this all planned out...

10:54.450 --> 10:56.660
Onee-chan! Onee-chan!

11:00.250 --> 11:01.290
Anna!

11:07.540 --> 11:08.540
Onee-chan!

11:15.120 --> 11:18.080
I'm sorry... She found out.

11:18.080 --> 11:19.870
Found out?

11:19.870 --> 11:22.540
About Malmcester.

11:22.540 --> 11:23.660
I see.

11:25.750 --> 11:28.000
Why were you hiding this?!

11:28.000 --> 11:29.450
For your own sake.

11:29.450 --> 11:31.660
How is that for my own sake?!

11:31.660 --> 11:34.080
It was the same thing
when I said I wanted to be a witch!

11:34.080 --> 11:36.830
Couldn't you at least consider how I feel?!

11:36.830 --> 11:41.790
I'm not your doll! I want to decide
my own path for myself!

11:42.750 --> 11:45.870
And that's how you were expelled, wasn't it?

11:45.870 --> 11:47.290
But that's...

11:47.290 --> 11:48.370
Though I'm the one who

11:48.370 --> 11:51.830
asked that you be put into a group
that could easily be expelled...

11:53.330 --> 11:54.330
What?

11:54.330 --> 11:55.580
No...

11:55.580 --> 11:59.370
Though it looks like
Chloe had her own ideas...

12:01.660 --> 12:04.500
The expulsion means nothing right now!

12:04.500 --> 12:08.660
I can't just keep quiet,
knowing everyone's in danger!

12:08.660 --> 12:10.950
What exactly do you plan on doing
once you get there?

12:12.200 --> 12:14.290
I... don't know.

12:14.290 --> 12:19.870
But even then, I'm sure
there's something I... we can do!

12:19.870 --> 12:21.250
Tiara's right.

12:21.250 --> 12:23.080
Let's all work together!

12:23.080 --> 12:25.950
This is when the ace is gonna show her stuff!

12:25.950 --> 12:28.160
Everyone...

12:28.160 --> 12:33.200
I might not have the potential
to become a witch like you.

12:33.200 --> 12:36.700
I might not be able to sing like Ray...

12:36.700 --> 12:42.620
But I... I want to become a witch
that only I can become!

12:42.620 --> 12:44.160
Along with all of them!

12:46.500 --> 12:49.200
It looks like you've grown at least a little.

12:49.200 --> 12:50.660
Then...

12:50.660 --> 12:53.500
But that's a separate matter.

12:56.790 --> 12:58.660
Onee-chan, you blockhead!

13:02.000 --> 13:03.950
That's impossible!

13:03.950 --> 13:05.250
Shh!

13:07.250 --> 13:10.370
I know this is a lot for us to handle...

13:10.370 --> 13:12.120
Then...

13:12.120 --> 13:14.620
But... we have to do it.

13:16.870 --> 13:19.040
Don't worry. It'll all work out—

13:19.040 --> 13:20.950
Of course, it won't!

13:22.580 --> 13:24.080
Champe!

13:26.910 --> 13:29.580
We can do that with an Orchestra?

13:29.580 --> 13:31.620
So what are we going to do?

13:31.620 --> 13:33.040
That should be obvious.

13:33.040 --> 13:37.290
We're going to sing rock
and put on a rockin' show.

13:37.290 --> 13:39.080
I figured you'd say that.

13:40.250 --> 13:43.000
Even at times like this,
all you can think about is rock.

13:44.500 --> 13:46.790
You're still really weird, Nadeshiko.

13:48.040 --> 13:51.450
But that's exactly what
makes you my older sister.

13:52.290 --> 13:55.870
Um... Was that a compliment?

13:55.870 --> 13:57.080
Well...

13:57.080 --> 14:00.660
I'm sure we'll be okay with our sisterly bond.

14:01.910 --> 14:03.700
What ever shall we do?

14:03.700 --> 14:07.540
I'm so scared my heart just might stop!

14:07.540 --> 14:10.370
Well, your heart is already on
a permanent vacation so—

14:10.370 --> 14:11.750
Anyway!

14:11.750 --> 14:16.120
We, IV KLORE, are going to
put on the best Orchestra ever!

14:16.120 --> 14:18.250
Yeah! Let's do this!

14:18.250 --> 14:19.750
Yeah!
Yes.
Indeed.

14:34.540 --> 14:35.620
You need to go to the bathroom?

14:35.620 --> 14:36.870
No!

14:36.870 --> 14:38.290
Then what is it?

14:38.290 --> 14:41.950
Is Ray's Angers-chan actually scared?

14:41.950 --> 14:44.580
It's just trembling with excitement!

14:44.580 --> 14:48.580
Not to mention, I'm not Angers anymore.

14:48.580 --> 14:51.540
I'm Angelica from Sadistic Candy.

14:52.750 --> 14:54.540
Right.

14:54.540 --> 14:58.120
And we have to show them what
we're made of every once in a while.

14:58.120 --> 15:01.620
We can't let the young'uns take all the glory.

15:09.450 --> 15:12.660
There! More to the right!

15:12.660 --> 15:14.620
Good... Good, good, good.

15:17.660 --> 15:20.160
Good, good.

15:20.160 --> 15:22.040
Out of the way.

15:22.040 --> 15:24.540
This will probably be another great year.

15:24.540 --> 15:27.790
Yeah. I basically live for this.

15:34.410 --> 15:36.040
Champe!

15:38.580 --> 15:40.830
Ratura... Mary...

15:42.620 --> 15:44.200
We finally found you.

15:48.410 --> 15:50.330
I'm sorry about earlier.

15:50.330 --> 15:52.330
Don't even worry about it.

15:52.330 --> 15:55.080
I don't blame you for wanting to run away.

15:56.290 --> 16:00.120
But remember you told me
that it's okay to fail.

16:00.120 --> 16:02.040
You just have to do your best first.

16:04.000 --> 16:05.950
Then...

16:05.950 --> 16:09.450
I realized when I was
looking at the city earlier...

16:09.450 --> 16:13.620
Everyone's looking forward
to the Cester Festival.

16:13.620 --> 16:15.660
Yeah, you're right.

16:15.660 --> 16:21.040
But if I run away,
the festival and everyone will...

16:22.450 --> 16:25.040
I know I shouldn't run away.

16:25.040 --> 16:26.790
I know that, but...

16:32.120 --> 16:33.700
Champe!

16:34.910 --> 16:36.500
Ratura?

16:36.500 --> 16:38.660
Why are you trying to figure
this out all by yourself?

16:40.660 --> 16:45.540
Even if you can't do this alone,
you have me and Mary.

16:45.540 --> 16:48.410
Don't ever forget that.

16:48.410 --> 16:52.160
I always rely on the both of you.

16:53.120 --> 16:56.870
So I want you two to rely on me
every once in a while, too... Maybe.

16:58.700 --> 17:01.200
There's no reason to get all worked up.

17:01.200 --> 17:05.250
We just need to do everything we can.

17:05.250 --> 17:07.700
Yeah... Yeah!

17:07.700 --> 17:09.000
Champe.

17:12.040 --> 17:15.120
And it's not just going to be us.

17:15.120 --> 17:17.790
We have Konohana, IV KLORE, supernova.

17:17.790 --> 17:21.040
And most importantly,
we have Angers-chan on our side!

17:21.040 --> 17:23.620
What could be better?

17:23.620 --> 17:28.620
We just need to rely on
everyone else like we usually do.

17:29.660 --> 17:33.410
Aren't we relying on everyone a bit too much?

17:33.410 --> 17:36.330
We just need to do everything we can.

17:36.330 --> 17:39.410
Hey, are you copying me?

17:39.410 --> 17:41.120
Nope!

17:48.120 --> 17:50.830
I'm so fired up!

17:50.830 --> 17:55.620
If only I could have my song carry
my magic just like Eliza-sama...

17:55.620 --> 18:00.580
Yue, there's no point in worrying
about that right now.

18:00.580 --> 18:05.660
I know. If I get to reduce some
Magical Monsters to ash with our Orchestra,

18:05.660 --> 18:07.500
I couldn't ask for anything more.

18:07.500 --> 18:11.200
If those girls were still around,
we'd have better odds.

18:11.200 --> 18:13.120
Are you talking about LiGHTs?

18:13.120 --> 18:14.950
Yes!

18:14.950 --> 18:17.950
I'm sure Tiara will be back someday.

18:17.950 --> 18:20.660
Yue-chin...

18:20.660 --> 18:24.750
So we need to make sure
she has a place to come back to.

18:29.410 --> 18:31.250
What should we do...?

18:31.250 --> 18:33.250
It didn't look like there was much hope.

18:34.040 --> 18:37.870
I don't really like her sister.

18:37.870 --> 18:40.120
She's sorta mean...

18:40.120 --> 18:42.580
That's rude. You're talking about the princess.

18:42.580 --> 18:46.200
More importantly, she's Eliza-sama from Ray!

18:46.200 --> 18:52.250
But the Eliza-sama I knew was always kind,
bright, and always smiling.

18:52.250 --> 18:55.870
I'm sure there's a bunch of stuff
commoners don't understand.

18:55.870 --> 18:57.870
You think so?

19:00.040 --> 19:02.080
We'll just have to sneak out together.

19:02.080 --> 19:03.080
Tia...

19:03.080 --> 19:05.500
Yes, I do believe that's the only way!

19:05.500 --> 19:09.870
I mean, we snuck in here pretty easily,
so we can probably make that work.

19:09.870 --> 19:11.700
There aren't a lot of guards right now, either.

19:13.000 --> 19:14.160
Honestly...

19:15.370 --> 19:18.200
If we're going to do this,
we need to succeed, no matter what.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.450
Rose...

19:21.790 --> 19:25.160
We don't have much time.
We need to come up with a plan now.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.330
Heck yeah.

19:26.330 --> 19:27.910
Strike while the iron's hot!

19:30.500 --> 19:31.540
Wait...

19:31.540 --> 19:33.790
Did they hear us?

19:33.790 --> 19:37.950
Pardon me. Um, Eliza-sama...

19:40.580 --> 19:42.290
What's this magic circle?

19:42.290 --> 19:43.950
It's for Transposition Magic...

19:43.950 --> 19:46.410
It's also very advanced.

19:46.410 --> 19:48.790
But to where?

19:48.790 --> 19:51.620
I would presume to Malmcester.

19:52.950 --> 19:54.500
Why?

19:54.500 --> 19:57.950
I do believe she had been using it
to travel from time to time.

19:59.790 --> 20:02.120
Then let's use this, too.

20:02.120 --> 20:04.950
That's a great idea.
Not bad coming from you, Lavie.

20:06.080 --> 20:10.410
That's not happening.
We wouldn't be able to use this.

20:10.410 --> 20:11.790
Aw...

20:11.790 --> 20:15.450
Anna, do you know when
the mission's going to be carried out?

20:15.450 --> 20:20.160
I heard it was the day of the Cester Festival,
but I'm not sure when that is.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.830
When is it?

20:21.830 --> 20:23.370
The Cester Festival is...

20:23.370 --> 20:24.450
The day after tomorrow!

20:24.450 --> 20:26.120
No! It's tomorrow!

20:26.120 --> 20:27.580
Tomorrow...

20:27.580 --> 20:31.080
Even if we went as fast
as we could by carriage...

20:31.080 --> 20:33.200
Then...

20:35.410 --> 20:39.620
My goodness, you ladies are
a bunch of troublemakers.

20:39.620 --> 20:41.410
Anna?

20:41.410 --> 20:43.950
I'll throw you a bone here.

20:50.410 --> 20:52.620
Whoa! What the heck is this?

20:52.620 --> 20:54.790
It looks like a ship.

20:54.790 --> 20:57.160
I've never been on this, either.

21:00.080 --> 21:01.870
Are you girls ready?

21:01.870 --> 21:03.750
Can you fly this?

21:03.750 --> 21:06.040
Let's make sure the queen doesn't find out.

21:07.620 --> 21:08.870
Let's go!

21:08.870 --> 21:12.000
You got it. Make sure you girls hold on tight!

21:19.370 --> 21:21.370
We're floating! We're floating!

21:31.580 --> 21:33.870
Wow, this is beautiful

21:33.870 --> 21:36.120
What a marvellous sight.

21:36.120 --> 21:38.870
Uh, aren't we a bit too high?

21:38.870 --> 21:40.500
Are our costumes done?

21:40.500 --> 21:42.330
I'll need a little more time.

21:42.330 --> 21:44.490
Then let's hurry up.

21:43.770 --> 21:45.230
Tiara-sama.

21:46.830 --> 21:48.000
Here.

21:50.660 --> 21:51.950
What's this?

21:51.950 --> 21:53.660
It's Eliza-sama's.

21:56.450 --> 21:57.790
Thank you...

21:59.200 --> 22:02.160
All right, let's floor it!

22:20.920 --> 22:30.820
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.920 --> 22:30.820
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.820 --> 22:39.520
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.820 --> 22:39.520
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.520 --> 22:44.320
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.520 --> 22:44.320
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.320 --> 22:49.120
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.320 --> 22:49.120
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.120 --> 22:51.820
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.120 --> 22:51.820
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.820 --> 22:55.570
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.820 --> 22:55.570
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.570 --> 22:58.720
zutto

22:55.570 --> 22:58.720
Forever

22:58.720 --> 23:00.820
It's shining stars

23:00.820 --> 23:05.620
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.820 --> 23:05.620
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.620 --> 23:10.720
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.620 --> 23:10.720
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.720 --> 23:15.670
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.720 --> 23:15.670
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.670 --> 23:19.270
watashi no planetarium

23:15.670 --> 23:19.270
My planetarium

23:19.270 --> 23:20.020
hora

23:19.270 --> 23:25.120
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:20.020 --> 23:25.120
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.120 --> 23:29.320
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.120 --> 23:29.320
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
